From: yooz <136268860+y-o-o-z@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 17:16:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] local: sign-in with IRCnet map panel, content-hash cache
 busting, theme fixes

- sign-in: two columns, the right one is a generated map of Europe with an
  IRCnet-style server tree (scripts/generate-ircnet-map.py, Natural Earth
  public domain data); the nick!web@host line is gone
- cache busting: vendor chunk named by content hash, ?v= computed from the
  built bundle instead of the version number, theme stylesheets versioned;
  a rebuild can no longer be served stale by Cloudflare
- tahio theme: readable 'Jump to' field and sidebar wordmark

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
